#### Revenue and Profitability Overview

LTS is on a strong growth trajectory. Calendar year 2024 revenue totaled $44.3M, rising 25.4% to $55.5M in 2025, with Q1 2026 annualizing at approximately $90.7M [1]. EBITDA has grown even faster, from $17.3M in 2024 to $24.2M in 2025 (+40.3%), with Q1 2026 annualizing near $42.4M [1]. Owen Pratt is targeting $80.8–100M in revenue by year-end 2026, tracking at ~$20.4M after Q1, and Neil Sanders has articulated a longer-term goal of expanding to $106M+ over the next two to three years [16][17].

